## 1. Recursion

```python
class Solution:
    def solve(self, i, prev, discs, n):
        if i == n:
            return 0

        not_take = self.solve(i + 1, prev, discs, n)

        take = 0
        if prev == -1 or (
            discs[i][0] > discs[prev][0]
            and discs[i][1] > discs[prev][1]
        ):
            take = discs[i][1] + self.solve(i + 1, i, discs, n)

        return max(take, not_take)

    def maxStackHeight(self, r, h):
        discs = sorted(zip(r, h))
        return self.solve(0, -1, discs, len(discs))
```

**TC:** O(2ⁿ)
**SC:** O(n)

