## 3. Tabulation (Bottom-Up)

```python
class Solution:
    def maxStackHeight(self, r, h):
        discs = sorted(zip(r, h))
        n = len(discs)

        dp = [0] * n
        ans = 0

        for i in range(n):
            dp[i] = discs[i][1]

            for j in range(i):
                if (
                    discs[j][0] < discs[i][0]
                    and discs[j][1] < discs[i][1]
                ):
                    dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[j] + discs[i][1])

            ans = max(ans, dp[i])

        return ans
```

**TC:** O(n²)
**SC:** O(n)

